  {
   "version": "Introduced in Senate",
   "date": "2020-08-04",
   "text": "Protect America's Children from Toxic Pesticides Act\n This bill modifies provisions related to the distribution, sale, and use of pesticides, including by cancelling the registration of organophosphates, neonicotinoids, and paraquat and by creating a process for interested individuals to submit a petition to designate an active ingredient or pesticide as a dangerous pesticide."
  }
